# Reference

The literal contract. Everything here is generated from source or documents a
shipped surface — no narrative, no recommendations.

- [CLI](/reference/cli/) — the `wyrd` binary: `auth`, `eval`, `principal`.
- [Card schemas](/api/schemas/) — generated field-level schemas for each card kind.
- [Cards overview](/cards/) — the component hub and kind status, not the field reference.
- [API](/api/) — error catalog, OpenAPI summary, and JSON Schema inventory.
